The URCLIMASK code is included in scripts/analysis/method_3_urclimask/urclimask/.
It is based on URCLIMASK commit b779ebc (2025-10-01) and was modified by
Leon Adriaensen (Ghent University) in 2025-2026. Each file there states at the
top whether and how it was modified. In short:
  - GHCNd_stations.py: unmodified;
  - urban_areas.py: bounds-safe cropping, descending lat/lon axes, safeguards
    against endless loops in the urban/rural mask iteration;
  - utils.py: urban/rural station classification (UCDB urban centre, LCZ),
    point-to-point UHI, p2a plotting, grid-alignment and mask-polygon helpers;
  - UHI_analysis.py: station grouping, obs/sim overlap checks, observed vs
    simulated UHI time series and additional plots;
  - load_data.py: new file, not part of upstream URCLIMASK.

